st consider the synergistic effects of these components to avoid performance issues and ensure reliable operation. [Data: Relationships (1170, 1151, 1152)]\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.0,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The impact severity rating is low-moderate due to the technical nature of the findings, which primarily affect network infrastructure and device compatibility rather than posing immediate widespread risks.\"\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null, "reasoning": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {"native_finish_reason": "STOP"}}], "created": 1787751038, "model": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": "default", "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 822, "prompt_tokens": 2236, "total_tokens": 3058, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "image_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0, "video_tokens": 0}, "cost": 0.0005524, "is_byok": false, "cost_details": {"upstream_inference_cost": 0.0005524, "upstream_inference_prompt_cost": 0.0002236, "upstream_inference_completions_cost": 0.0003288}}, "formatted_response": null, "provider": "Google", "content": "{\n    \"title\": \"Power over Ethernet (PoE) Limitations and Standards\",\n    \"summary\": \"This community focuses on the technical aspects of Power over Ethernet (PoE) systems, specifically the power limitations that arise. The key entities are Network Cable Category, Power Limitations, and PoE Standard, all interconnected to explain how different cable types and PoE standards influence the power delivery capabilities and constraints within PoE networks. The core issue is how these factors combine to create power limitations.